يۆتكەش box 10       ; Put 10 candies in the box
قوشۇش box 5        ; Get 5 more candies (15)
ئېلىش box 2        ; Eat 2 candies (13 left!)
سىستېما_چاقىرىقى box         ; Show the final candy count!
